# Allowlist: only what's needed to build the wheel. Without this the 766MB
# .venv, the git history and node_modules are uploaded to the daemon on every
# build. README.md is required because pyproject.toml declares it as `readme`.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/

# Re-exclude noise from inside the allowed directories.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
